            "review_title": "Review at Saiko Sushi",
            "review_text": "Anna R\n3 contributions\n0\nIf you are looking for authentic, high-quality Unbeatable Freshness and Exceptional Service! 5/5 ⭐\nSep 2026 • Friends\nIf you are looking for authentic, high-quality Japanese cuisine, Saiko Sushi is an absolute must-visit! The sashimi is incredibly fresh, melt-in-your-mouth delicious, and the sushi rolls are beautifully crafted with perfect flavor balance. Beyond the fantastic food, the ambiance is warm and welcoming, and the staff provides top-notch, attentive service from start to finish. A true gem for sushi lovers! Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2026\nDreamer01072488682\nThank you so much for your wonderful review and 5-star rating! ⭐❤️ We’re thrilled to hear that you enjoyed our fresh sashimi, sushi, atmosphere, and attentive service. Your kind words mean a lot to our team. We look forward to welcoming you back to Saiko Sushi soon! 🍣🥰\nRead more\nWritten September 25, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
