            "review_text": "Passport13317431561\n1 contribution\n0\nA wonderful dinner, delicious food and a very pleasant atmosphere\nAug 2026 • Friends\nI had a very fun evening with friends at Saiko. The space is beautiful, clean, and quite cozy, suitable for both eating and chatting. The dish is beautifully presented, delicious in flavor, and the ingredients feel very fresh. The service staff are enthusiastic, friendly, and quick.\n\nA place worth revisiting if you want a delicious and comfortable meal with friends. I will definitely come back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 18, 2026\nDreamer01072488682\nThank you so much for your lovely review! ❤️ We’re delighted to hear that you enjoyed the food, atmosphere, and service at Saiko. Your kind words mean a lot to our team. We look forward to welcoming you back again soon! 🥰\nRead more\nWritten September 25, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
